SUMMARY:Mindfulness in the Garden (Weekend Classes)
DESCRIPTION:Mindfulness in the Garden (Weekend Classes) \nSaturdays\, 9:30 AM – 10:30 AM \nApril 18th \nMay 9th \nJune 13th \nInstructor: Jodi Brooks \nDiscover how a mindfulness practice can help us awaken and  live in harmony with oneself and with the natural world. Each class will include: simple instructions for getting started with a formal mindfulness practice\, very gentle stretching & breathwork\, and an outdoor contemplative garden walk. This is a practice of slowing down\, cultivating quiet and paying attention to our senses. All levels are welcome. No experience needed. Cold or rainy weather – class will be held indoors\, with a short walk outdoors (weather permitting). \nFee per class:  $20 Members / $25 General Public \nPre Registration is required.  There are no drop-ins for this class. \n \nDates of our weekday Mindfulness series: \nLate Spring Session: May 5\, 12 19 & 26 \nEarly Summer Session: June 2\, 9\, 16 & 23
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/mindfulness-in-the-garden-weekend-classes-4/
