SUMMARY:Second Sunday Concert: New Jersey Symphony Brass Quintet on Mother's Day
DESCRIPTION:May 10 – Annual Mother’s Day brass quintet concert on the Bingham formal lawn at Van Vleck Gardens. \nPlease bring a blanket or lawn chair and enjoy beautiful music in a tranquil setting. \nNo pets\, food or alcoholic beverages are permitted. \nThe registration link was sent to Series Patrons\, Members and is now open for the general public. \n \nReservations are strongly recommended. Walk-ins without reservations will be seated on a space-available basis. \nThis concert is free but a donation of $10 at the door is greatly appreciated to support the series. \nThe event is weather-dependent so please check our website and your email if the forecast is uncertain.
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/second-sunday-concert-nj-symphony-on-mothers-day/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Events,Adults,Family
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2025/10/USATSI_20667251-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
